{
  "_note": "世界时钟(clock / clock11 / clock21 / clock42 共用)。零网络:设备本地偏移由 formatDate 拆出的墙上钟反算,目标城市偏移 = 包内城市表的标准偏移 + 按规则算出的当年夏令时。入参 c1..c4 = 城市 id(空 = 按地区缺省),n = 42 卡显示几行。生成器 tools/infosource/gen_moment_clock.py,设计 doc/moment-worldclock.md。",
  "version": 1,
  "actions": [
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "now",
        "value": "${@time.nowMs}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "u",
        "value": "$[floor::(calc::(${now}/60000))]"
      },
      "_note": "UTC 分钟(1970 起)。时区换算全在整数分钟上做。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "ly",
        "value": "$[formatDate::(${now},yyyy)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "lm",
        "value": "$[formatDate::(${now},M)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "ld",
        "value": "$[formatDate::(${now},d)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "lH",
        "value": "$[formatDate::(${now},H)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "lN",
        "value": "$[formatDate::(${now},m)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "ly2",
        "value": "$[if::(le::(${lm},2),calc::(${ly}-1),${ly})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "lmp",
        "value": "$[if::(gt::(${lm},2),calc::(${lm}-3),calc::(${lm}+9))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "l4",
        "value": "$[floor::(calc::(${ly2}/4))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "l100",
        "value": "$[floor::(calc::(${ly2}/100))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "l400",
        "value": "$[floor::(calc::(${ly2}/400))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "lq",
        "value": "$[floor::(calc::((153*${lmp}+2)/5))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "lDay",
        "value": "$[calc::(365*${ly2}+${l4}-${l100}+${l400}+${lq}+${ld}-1-719468)]"
      },
      "_note": "本地日期距 1970-01-01 的天数(days_from_civil)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "lob",
        "value": "$[calc::(${lDay}*1440+${lH}*60+${lN}+720-${u})]"
      },
      "_note": "设备本地偏移 + 720(偏置,恒正)。⚠️ 不用 parseDate 反推:同一个时间戳进出一趟拿不到偏移。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_lh",
        "value": "$[if::(lt::(${lH},10),0${lH},${lH})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_ln",
        "value": "$[if::(lt::(${lN},10),0${lN},${lN})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "lt",
        "value": "${_lh}:${_ln}"
      },
      "_note": "本地时间(42 卡右上角):桌面小组件不是每分钟重画,这一格让人对得出这张卡是几点算的。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "cnd",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${@app.region},cn),1,if::(eq::(${@app.region},overseas),0,if::(startsWith::(${@app.language},zh),1,0)))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_cc",
        "value": "k${@app.country}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "CG",
        "value": {
          "kAE": 5,
